              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "欧洲军费飙升\nNATO设定GDP 3.5%新目标",
              "lineHeight": 1.1,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 50,
              "fontWeight": "900"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l547Q",
              "name": "subT6",
              "fill": "#2563EBFF",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2024年总支出$1.47万亿 · 目标再加1.5%安全投资",
              "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "2k2RW",
              "name": "divT6",
              "fill": "#7C3AEDFF",
              "width": 80,
              "height": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HRMYe",
              "name": "bodyT6",
              "fill": "#3F3F46FF",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "海牙峰会上，32个NATO成员国中31国承诺将核心军费提升至GDP的3.5%，另加1.5%安全投资，总目标达5%。欧洲盟国2024年军费已超4820亿美元，为冷战以来最高水平。秘书长吕特批评部分盟国\"未通过考验\"。",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "CdCJM",
              "name": "anaBg6",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#EDE9FEFF",
